{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swidux ships a companion agent skill ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"swidux-ref"},{"type":"text","text":") for AI coding assistants like Claude Code. It contains the architecture rules, conventions, and code templates an assistant needs to generate correct Swidux code without you re-explaining the patterns."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The skill is published in ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/heirloomlogic\/skills","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" — Heirloom Logic’s public skills repo — alongside any future Heirloom skills. Two files:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"SKILL.md","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" — architecture rules (the 10 rules, the dispatch lifecycle, plugin shapes, anti-patterns)."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"swidux-patterns.md"},{"type":"text","text":" — copy-pasteable code templates for "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AppState"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AppAction"},{"type":"text","text":", reducers, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AppStore"},{"type":"text","text":" factory, views, plugin wiring, and Swift Testing reducer tests."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"Installing the skill","type":"heading","anchor":"Installing-the-skill","level":2},{"anchor":"GitHub-CLI-recommended","text":"GitHub CLI (recommended)","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Requires ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"gh"},{"text":" ≥ v2.90.0 (","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/cli.github.com"},{"type":"text","text":")."}]},{"syntax":"bash","type":"codeListing","code":["gh skill install heirloomlogic\/skills swidux-ref --agent claude-code --scope user"]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"--scope user","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" installs to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"~\/.claude\/skills\/swidux-ref\/"},{"type":"text","text":" (loads in every project)."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"--scope project","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" installs to "},{"code":"<cwd>\/.claude\/skills\/swidux-ref\/","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (commit it so the whole team gets it)."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Pin a version with "},{"code":"swidux-ref@v1.2.3","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". List tags with "},{"code":"git ls-remote --tags https:\/\/github.com\/heirloomlogic\/skills","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Other agents: pass "},{"code":"--agent codex","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"--agent cursor","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"--agent gemini-cli","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", etc. Run "},{"code":"gh skill install --help","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for the full list."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"skills.sh","type":"heading","anchor":"skillssh","level":3},{"syntax":"bash","type":"codeListing","code":["npx skillsadd heirloomlogic\/skills"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Indexes the same source repo. Works without a GitHub CLI install.","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Manual (no `gh`, no `npx`)","type":"heading","anchor":"Manual-no-gh-no-npx","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Claude Code uses ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".claude\/skills\/"},{"text":". Codex, Cursor, Gemini CLI, and others use ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".agents\/skills\/"},{"text":". Pick the director